> So, any ideas what I should take? 

Digging, teleport, gold detection, some means to confuse yourself, 
holy water, full healing.  Be very afraid of role monsters (healer, 
knight etc.), since they can have artifact weapons and have nasty 
tricks sometimes (eg, they can steal your weapon with a bullwhip, 
or decapitate you with Vorpal Blade).  If you want to be a little 
cautious, use conflict all the time, it really helps.  But considering 
your stats, I think that only the riders might be a challenge.  To 
be very sure, you can wear free action to prevent getting paralyzed 
while a rider is nearby (thrown potions of paralyzation could do 
this).  Use the level-port trick to come from Rodney to the VS, 
perform the ritual, then level-port down one level.  Unless you 
end up in the left hand side of the sanctum, port up and immediately 
down again.  Kill the high priest, get the amulet, quaff a cursed 
potion of gain level.  Pick up and stuff in the BoH every cockatrice 
corpse you find (*don't* carry it in the main inventory, don't even 
make one move with a cokatrice corpse in the main inventory!) and use 
them each time Rodney pokes in.  

